Verse 1:
[Bb]There’s a [F7]wideness, in God’s [Bb]mercy,
[Eb]Like [Bb]the [F7]wide[Bb]ness [C]of [C7]the [F]sea;
[F7]There’s a [Bb]kindness [F7]in His [Bb]justice,
[Gm]Which [Ebm]is[Bb]more [Gm]than [F7]liber[Bb]ty.

Verse 2:
[Bb]There is [F7]welcome, for [Bb]the sinner,
[Eb][Bb]and [F7]more [Bb]graces [C]for [C7]the [F]good;
[F7]There [Bb]is mercy, [F7]with [Bb]the Savior,
[Gm]There [Ebm]is [Bb]healing [Gm]in [F7]His [Bb]blood.

Verse 3:
[Bb]For the [F7]love of [Bb]God is broader
[Eb][Bb]Than [F7]the [Bb]measure [C]of [C7]man's [F]mind.
[F7]And [Bb]the heart [F7]of [Bb]the Eternal,
[Gm][Ebm]is [Bb]most [Gm][F7]wonderfully [Bb]kind.

Verse 4:
[Bb]If our [F7]love were [Bb]but more simple,
[Eb]We [Bb]should [F7]take [Bb]Him [C]at [C7]His [F]word;
[F7]And [Bb]our lives [F7]would be [Bb]all sunshine,
[Gm]In [Ebm]the [Bb]sweetness [Gm]of [F7]our [Bb]Lord.
